  FirstName: Irina
  LastName: Kakulia
  Nickname: Iri
  Occupation: Nurse
  CharacterDescription: Granddaughter of Mzia. Student nurse currently taking care of her Grandmother. Takes care of the elderly for her work. Very spiritual in a hippie way and says very hippie things about the universe and stuff all the time. Personally struggling with the balancing of her studies and taking care of her grandmother. Secretly an addict taking drugs to cope with the stress.
  CharacterArc: Irina arrived at the crisis as a true believer, convinced that love, intention, and the right frequency of thought could soften any catastrophe. As the radiation spread, her nursing shifts grew longer, her grandmother frailer, and her supply of pills quieter but more essential. She still speaks in soft certainties about healing and universal energy, but the tremor in her hands tells a different story. By the final days her spiritual language has become a shell she hides inside, repeating mantras she no longer believes, hoping the universe will answer before the withdrawal does.
